'''Blaenau Gwent and Rhymney''' ({{lang-cy|Blaenau Gwent a Rhymni}}) is a [[List of UK Parliament constituencies|constituency]] of the [[House of Commons of the United Kingdom|House of Commons]] in the [[Parliament of the United Kingdom|UK Parliament]], that was first contested at the [[2024 United Kingdom general election]], following the [[2023 Periodic Review of Westminster constituencies]].

